browse context:</h3>\n     <div class=\"current\">cs.AI</div>\n     <div class=\"prevnext\">\n      <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button prev-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2609.20804&amp;function=prev&amp;context=cs.AI\" accesskey=\"p\" title=\"previous in cs.AI (accesskey p)\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;&nbsp;prev</a> </span> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">&nbsp; | &nbsp;</span> <span class=\"arrow\"> <a class=\"abs-button next-url\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/prevnext?id=2609.20804&amp;function=next&amp;context=cs.AI\" accesskey=\"n\" title=\"next in cs.AI (accesskey n)\" rel=\"nofollow\">next&nbsp;&gt;</a> </span>\n      <br>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"list\">\n      <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-new\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">new</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-recent\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/recent\" rel=\"nofollow\">recent</a> <span class=\"is-hidden-mobile\"> | </span><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small context-id\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/list/cs.AI/2026-09\" rel=\"nofollow\">2026-09</a>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"abs-switch-cat\">\n      Change to browse by:\n      <div class=\"switch context-change\">\n       <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804?context=cs\" rel=\"nofollow\">cs</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a class=\"subclass\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804?context=cs.CL\" rel=\"nofollow\">cs.CL</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a class=\"subclass\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804?context=cs.LG\" rel=\"nofollow\">cs.LG</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n       <a class=\"subclass\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804?context=cs.SE\" rel=\"nofollow\">cs.SE</a>\n       <br class=\"is-hidden-mobile\">\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <h3>References &amp; Citations</h3>\n     <ul>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-ads\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/arXiv:2609.20804\">NASA ADS</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-google-scholar\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?arxiv_id=2609.20804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Scholar</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-semantic-scholar\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/arXiv:2609.20804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Semantic Scholar</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <button type=\"button\" id=\"bib-cite-trigger\" class=\"bib-cite-button abs-button\">export BibTeX citation</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bookmarks\">\n     <div>\n      <h3>Bookmark</h3>\n     </div>\n     <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"http://www.bibsonomy.org/BibtexHandler?requTask=upload&amp;url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804&amp;description=An Empirical Study of Harness Design for Coding Agents\" title=\"Bookmark on BibSonomy\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/bibsonomy.png\" alt=\"BibSonomy\"> </a> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"https://reddit.com/submit?url=https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.20804&amp;title=An Empirical Study of Harness Design for Coding Agents\" title=\"Bookmark on Reddit\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/reddit.png\" alt=\"Reddit\"> </a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end extra-services-->\n   <!-- LABS AREA -->\n   <div id=\"labstabs\"></div>\n   <!-- END LABS AREA -->\n   <div class=\"endorsers\">\n    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/auth/show-endorsers/2609.20804\" class=\"endorser-who\" rel=\"nofollow\">Which authors of this paper are endorsers?</a> | Disable MathJax (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/mathjax.html\">What is MathJax?</a>) <span class=\"help\" style=\"font-style: normal; float: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 1em;\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本项实证研究将自主编码智能体的架构拆解为规划、动作空间和上下文管理三个组件，揭示了各组件如何影响不同模型能力下的性能、成本与效率。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本项实证研究将自主编码智能体的架构拆解为规划、动作空间和上下文管理三个组件，揭示了各组件如何影响不同模型能力下的性能、成本与效率。",
  "summary": "本文对编码智能体架构进行了系统性的组件级分析，超越了以往单一的整体评估模式。通过隔离规划、动作空间和上下文管理这三个核心组件，作者在 SWE-Bench Verified 和 Terminal-Bench 2.1 上针对四种模型进行了 176 组实验。主要发现包括：上下文管理对于防止受限窗口内的溢出至关重要；「基于规则的删减 + 基于 LLM 的摘要」的混合方法最为高效；规划对于较弱模型而言是提升准确率的支架，而对于较强模型则主要起到节省成本的作用；具备 Bash 能力的模型在仅使用 Bash 接口时表现优于使用预定义工具。该研究为设计兼顾预算与模型特性的智能体架构提供了一个模块化框架。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "上下文管理在严格约束下至关重要",
      "explanation": "其核心价值在于防止上下文溢出导致的失败，其中结合了基于规则的删减与基于 LLM 的摘要的策略被证明最为高效。"
    },
    {
      "point": "规划的作用因模型能力而异",
      "explanation": "对于较弱的模型，规划充当了提升准确率的支架；而对于较强的模型，它主要作为一种节省成本的机制，对整体准确率的影响较小。"
    },
    {
      "point": "动作空间设计影响效率与成本",
      "explanation": "具备强大 Bash 熟练度的模型在使用仅限 Bash 的接口时能获得更好的结果并降低成本，而预定义工具仅对 Bash 能力较弱的模型有益。"
    },
    {
      "point": "组件级模块化为架构设计提供指导",
      "explanation": "研究表明不同组件以不同方式影响智能体行为：上下文管理延长了执行时间，规划决定了终止时机，而动作空间则改变了代码编写的粒度。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "编码架构决定了自主编码智能体如何将模型能力转化为长周期的软件工程表现，然而现有研究通常将架构视为单一系统进行评估，导致各组件的有效性尚不明确。",
    "随着上下文窗口预算的收紧，上下文管理变得愈发重要，其大部分收益来自于防止上下文溢出导致的失败。",
    "规划的作用从较弱模型的准确率支架转变为较强模型的成本节省工具，且对准确率的影响微乎其微。"
  ],
